sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Gateway API<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant EPP as llm-d-router EPP<br/>8081/TCP HTTP
    participant Prefill as Prefill Pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant NIXL as NIXL Transfer<br/>5600/TCP
    participant Decode as Decode Pod<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,Decode: Flow 1: Standard Inference Request (Optimized Baseline)
    Client->>GW: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP :80, No Auth
    GW->>EPP: Route selection<br/>HTTP :8081
    Note over EPP: Plugin chain evaluates:<br/>prefix-cache-affinity<br/>inflight-load<br/>token-load scoring
    EPP->>Decode: Forward to selected pod<br/>HTTP :8000
    Decode-->>EPP: Inference result
    EPP-->>GW: Response
    GW-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,Decode: Flow 2: Prefill/Decode Disaggregation
    Client->>GW: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTP :80, No Auth
    GW->>EPP: Route selection<br/>HTTP :8081
    EPP->>Prefill: Forward to prefill pod<br/>HTTP :8000
    Note over Prefill: Compute KV-cache<br/>for input tokens
    Prefill->>NIXL: KV-cache transfer<br/>TCP :5600
    NIXL->>Decode: Receive KV-cache
    Note over Decode: Generate output tokens<br/>using transferred cache
    Decode-->>GW: Streaming response<br/>HTTP :8000
    GW-->>Client: Streaming JSON

    Note over Client,HF: Flow 3: Model Loading (Startup)
    Decode->>HF: Download model weights<br/>HTTPS :443, Bearer HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>Decode: Model artifacts
    Note over Decode: Load weights into<br/>GPU/CPU memory
    Decode->>Decode: Bind port 8000<br/>Begin serving

    Note over Client,Decode: Flow 4: GKE Pod Snapshot (Cold-Start Optimization)
    Note over Decode: vLLM startup complete
    Decode->>Decode: engine.sleep(level=1)
    Note over Decode: /proc/gvisor/checkpoint<br/>Write "1" to trigger snapshot
    Note over Decode: Container restore from snapshot
    Decode->>Decode: engine.wake_up()
    Decode->>Decode: Bind port 8000<br/>Resume serving
